## Success Criteria

Scene is **SUCCESSFUL** if:

- All critical constraints met
- Word count {{WORD_COUNT_TARGET}}
- Russian language (literary quality)
- Beat structure present
- Prose style follows guidelines (no lists, sensory weaving)
- Compliance report: status "PASS"

