## Troubleshooting

**Problem**: "Which file to read first?"
-> **Solution**: `01-MAIN-PROMPT.md`

**Problem**: "Blueprint says X but constraints say Y"
-> **Solution**: Constraints (02-constraints.json) override blueprint

**Problem**: "Can't fit word count"
-> **Solution**: Expand atmospheric details, prioritize longer beats

**Problem**: "What if I mess up constraint?"
-> **Solution**: Mark status "FAIL", explain in notes, be honest

